title: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › Send back to Scribe
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 5 of 5, then step 4 and back)
intro: Anyone on the Sign card can send the draft back, with or without a note, and so can the 'Send back to Scribe' button under What is missing. Scribe, Integrity, Packet and Scrubber run again in a few seconds and the person returns to review. The note is added to the Plan section.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 5, click 'Send back to Scribe'\nOr the same button on an item under What is missing"
overlay o1 "Send back to Scribe\n'Scribe, Integrity, Packet and Scrubber run again with your note. It takes a few seconds.'\nBox: 'What should Scribe change?'"
input iNote "Type a note, or leave the box empty\n'Optional. Your note is added to the plan section.'"
click cQ1 "Click 'Say more about the risk at home'"
click cQ2 "Click 'Shorten the clinical picture'"
click cQ3 "Click 'Mention the lower levels of care that were tried'"
process pFill "The chip's words fill the note box"
click cCancel "Click 'Cancel', press Escape, or click outside"
endx eCancel "Pop-up closes; nothing changes"
click cSend "Click 'Send back'"
store st1 "The draft goes back to step 4 with six agents done\nThe summary is cleared\nA revision count goes up by one\nThe note is kept"
process pReset "Both tick-boxes on the Sign card are unticked"
toast t1 "'Sent back to Scribe'\n'The agents are re-drafting. You will see the new draft in a moment.'"
screen sRun "Step 4 'Authorization preparation'\nThe first six agents stay done"

group gRerun "The four agents run again"
  agent a1 "Scribe · 2.2 s\nWrites the summary again"
  agent a2 "Integrity · 1.4 s\nChecks every sentence again"
  agent a3 "Packet · 1.3 s\nAssembles the form again"
  agent a4 "Scrubber · 1.0 s\nChecks the request for errors again"
endgroup

process pNoQ "No new question is asked\nEarlier answers stay in the draft"
toast tDone "Banner: 'All ten agents are done'"
click cReview "Click 'Review & submit'"
screen sRev "Step 5 again\nThe Plan section ends: 'Reviewer's note, addressed: YOUR NOTE'"
click cStay "Click the browser's Back, or leave"
process pAway "The run only moves while step 4 is open"
goto gSign "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › Sign and send to payer"

s1 --> o1
o1 --> iNote
o1 --> cQ1 & cQ2 & cQ3 --> pFill --> iNote
o1 --> cCancel --> eCancel
iNote --> cSend --> st1 --> pReset --> t1 --> sRun --> a1 --> a2 --> a3 --> a4 --> pNoQ --> tDone --> cReview --> sRev --> gSign
sRun --> cStay --> pAway
